  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, Kailh/Gateron hot-swap socket and through-hole soldering, the hole of the socket is plated, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R2.00 corner relief (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: 1.00u (courtyard 19.00x19.00mm).")
